        "toggleCaps": "Toggle Caps Lock|Alternar Caps Lock|Caps Lock değiştir|Переключить Caps Lock|Alternar Caps Lock|Prepnúť Caps Lock|Caps Lock umschalten|Basculer Caps Lock|Attiva/disattiva Caps Lock|Caps Lockを切り替え|Caps Lock 전환|Перемкнути Caps Lock|切换大写锁定|切換大寫鎖定|切換大寫鎖定".components(separatedBy: "|"),
